{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Chatting with Vanessa"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le06ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " On the Phone"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Talking on the phone in your second language can be a challenge. In English, there are certain common polite phrases you use to start and end a conversation, especially in a business context."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Sometimes you might have limited time to be on the phone because you have work to do or you get interrupted. It's important to manage a phone conversation to suit your needs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some phrases you can use to end a phone conversation in a polite way:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm sorry, but I have to go.<br/> Look, I have to get back to work. / I have something cooking on the stove. / I need to get back to my kids.<br/> Listen, I'm running out of time. / It's getting late.</span></span><br/> ... followed by<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Can we talk about this later?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "It's good to start with <span class=\"italic\">\u201cI'm sorry, but ... \u201d</span> to be apologetic about cutting the conversation short."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you know the person well, saying <span class=\"italic\">\u201cLook\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cListen\u201d</span> catches the other person's attention."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some phrases for starting and ending a phone call."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Receiver\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> Receiver</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Caller</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Greeting/ Inquiring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hello, this is Jason. Could I speak to Aidan please?</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Sure. Just a moment please.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Thank you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Starting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hi, Jason. How are you?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Pretty good. How are you?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ending\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm sorry, but I have to go.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> No problem. I'll talk to you later.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" End Greeting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Alright. Thanks. Take care.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You, too. See you soon. Bye.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Phrasal Verbs about Phone Communication"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. Some phrasal verbs are unique to communication on the phone."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the following list of phrasal verbs. Try to use some of these the next time you're on the phone."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> Phrasal Verb</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Meaning</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call up/ring up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call and try to reach someone on the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to get through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to succeed in speaking to someone on the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to set up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to arrange another call or video chat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to hang on/ to hold on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to wait for a short time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to connect a caller to someone in the office\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to pick up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to answer a phone call\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "live"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to see someone or something on a screen in real time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa's dad was happy to see her live while he was talking with her."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"t