 phone conversation that talks about work."}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le06ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi, Dad. How are you doing? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: Oh, Vanessa. Am I looking at you live?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, Dad. It's nice to see your face.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: This computer video thing is neat. I'm not up with all this new technology stuff in my job. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's called video-chatting. We can use internet data to transmit video on a laptop now. So ... you look pretty well.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le06ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "27000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: Oh, thanks. Well, I feel up for going back to work actually. How is your job, Vanessa? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, there's been a lot of pressure managing the staff, but I'm keeping up with it.\nDad, if you go home, a nurse could come over and look in on you once a week.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le06ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "45000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Lily</span>: Then you'd be able to take walks at the park, George. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Listen, I have to get back to work in a bit. You should also ask the home nurse to prescribe a healthy diet, OK? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: I'd better call up my boss. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Lily</span>: Oh, George, you ought to take it easy for a while. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm sorry, but I have to go. Let's set up another call again. It's free. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Lily</span>: You take care of yourself, sweetie. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You, too. I'll see you both soon. Bye.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le06ob01re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}, {"contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi, Dad. How are you doing? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: Oh, Vanessa. Am I looking at you live?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, Dad. It's nice to see your face.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: This computer video thing is neat. I'm not up with all this new technology stuff in my job. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's called video-chatting. We can use internet data to transmit video on a laptop now. So ... you look pretty well.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: Oh, thanks. Well, I feel up for going back to work actually. How is your job, Vanessa? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, there's been a lot of pressure managing the staff, but I'm keeping up with it.\nDad, if you go home, a nurse could come over and look in on you once a week.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Lily</span>: Then you'd be able to take walks at the park, George. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Listen, I have to get back to work in a bit. You should also ask the home nurse to prescribe a healthy diet, OK? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dad</span>: I'd better call up my boss. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Lily</span>: Oh, George, you ought to take it easy for a while. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm sorry, but I have to go. Let's set up another call again. It's free. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Lily</span>: You take care of yourself, sweetie. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You, too. I'll see you both soon. Bye."}], "template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}